nty&rsquo;s 4 grids, January to February, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years. In 2025 September to October came in at 43% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 so far March to April sits at 165%. Grid 25667 had its driest year in 1963 at 61%.</p>"}
